# Static confirmation-dialog microbenchmark.
# The camera and UI do not move, so every configuration measures exactly the
# same scene.  The dialog is small on the CPU (GPU-bound on the M1); use the
# [perf] gpu_ms value, not fps, to compare upscalers at a matched render scale.
0 waitsteady 120 9
10 tap 28
20 waitsteady 90 20
600 quit
